# A SUPPLIED initial memory image for the whole PicoRV32 unit.
# The flops are taken from the design's DECLARED RESET VALUES, which the file
# asks for explicitly -- that part is synthetic and the driver says so.
# The memory image is supplied: a nonzero default and non-ramp words, so a
# substituted zero table or generated pattern would be visible.
memstate v1
flops reset
mem 5 32 4294967295
word 0 19088743
word 1 2309737967
word 2 305419896
word 3 2882400001
word 17 48879
word 31 3735928559
